   - Solved and verified (typecheck clean, and where possible live-tested via local dev server or direct browser reproduction): document-count mismatch (file-type allowlist), Team Portfolio→Portfolio Profile slow load (cache warm-up at source), PXC Profile breadcrumb/Key-Portfolio-Items/Worked-Total/Add-Existing-Tasks missing-until-refresh bugs, generic `safeMergeRow` field-wipe bug, Task Profile update/add callback propagation bugs, RadimadeTable local-tree-insert-fails-silently bug (Add Workstream-Task), and the `SelectedItem.NoteCall` stale-mutation bug causing the wrong create-popup to open.
